      "text": "prophesied of Christ’s burial, three days of darkness, 1 Ne. 19:10, 12. predicted gathering of Israel, 1 Ne. 19:16. Jacob2 quotes Zenos’s parable of olive tree, Jacob 5. Jacob2 expounds Zenos’s allegory, Jacob 6:1–10. Zenos’s words on worship and prayer, Alma 33:3–11. Zenos said, Thou hast turned away judgments because of thy Son, Alma 33:13. taught that redemption comes through the Son, Alma 34:7. slain for bold testimony, Hel. 8:19. spoke of restoration of Lamanites, Hel. 15:11. testified of destruction at Christ’s death, 3 Ne. 10:15–16.",
